0.0,0.0,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"You stay in the shadows and approach the pirate slowly. You hide as best you can and start throwing pebbles at him to get his attention. But as you peek out to see if he’s coming, you’re instead faced with an ambush of librarians. The may-be pirate seems to have been a decoy, and the librarians are so quiet, you never had a chance.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":18.496,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":65,"words":65},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":18.44,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":65,"words":65},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"They corner you in a classic pincer maneuver. One group pours out of the main doors while another spills from a vehicle on the street. They attack with a battle cry of, \"355 to 356! Military science, infantry forces and warfare!\" Then a dozen of them are upon you with rulers, compasses, and weaponized bookmarks. You draw your cutlass and swing it at the nearest one, but the blade's immediately snapped shut between the pages of a copy of Paradoxes of Defence (George Silver, 1599) and then wrenched out of your grasp.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":18.912,"end":48.768,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":92,"words":92},"large":{"start":18.912,"end":48.768,"frac":0.967,"status":"ok","matched":89,"words":92},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You're left unarmed and raise your hands in surrender. You're marched to their headquarters and down to its hidden sub-basement dungeon where you are locked away for the rest of your days.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":49.408,"end":59.776,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":33},"large":{"start":49.408,"end":59.776,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":33},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Since you have nothing but time to kill, you might as well take one last picture for your pirate coat of arms. Nothing says ‘fear me’ like a prison selfie, right?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":60.256,"end":68.864,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"large":{"start":60.256,"end":68.864,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92d35549fb_crest_v2.png"}